## 6. TYPOGRAPHY SOVEREIGNTY

Typography is 80% of a UI's premium feel. Generic fonts are the mark of amateurs.

| Role | Font | Tailwind Class |
|---|---|---|
| Display / Hero | Syne (700) | `font-display font-bold` |
| Body / UI | Inter (400/500) | `font-sans` |
| Mono / Code | JetBrains Mono | `font-mono` |
| Accent / Brand | Outfit (600) | `font-accent` |

- All fonts MUST be loaded from Google Fonts with `display=swap`.
- System font fallbacks: `ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system`.
- Type scale follows `1.25` modular scale: `text-sm` (14), `text-base` (16), `text-lg` (20), `text-xl` (25), `text-2xl` (31).
- **Line height**: Body `leading-relaxed` (1.625). Display `leading-tight` (1.1). Never `leading-none` on multi-line text.

---

## 7. THE WOW AUDIT CHECKLIST

Before marking any UI component as "done", verify:

| Check | Standard |
|---|---|
| ☐ Entrance animation | Spring-based, not flat ease |
| ☐ Hover state | Scale + Y translate micro-interaction |
| ☐ Dark mode | `dark:` variants present and tested |
| ☐ Mobile | Verified at 375px — no overflow, no clipped text |
| ☐ Loading state | Skeleton or spinner — never blank flash |
| ☐ Error state | Friendly message, not raw error string |
| ☐ Empty state | Illustrated or copy-driven — never blank |
| ☐ Typography | Custom font loaded, not system default |
| ☐ Colour | HSL/brand token — no plain colour names |
| ☐ `data-testid` | Present on all interactive elements |

If any box is unchecked: the component is **not done**.
